tyle="opacity:0;transform:translateY(10%) translateZ(0)">a</span><span style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(10%) translateZ(0)">s</span><span style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(10%) translateZ(0)">.</span></div>​</span><span data-testid="animated-words"><div class="sc-aa5615b6-6 ePCqHY"><span style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(10%) translateZ(0)">I</span><span style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(10%) translateZ(0)">n</span><span style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(10%) translateZ(0)">n</span><span style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(10%) translateZ(0)">o</span><span style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(10%) translateZ(0)">v</span><span style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(10%) translateZ(0)">a</span><span style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(10%) translateZ(0)">t</span><span style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(10%) translateZ(0)">i</span><span style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(10%) translateZ(0)">o</span><span style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(10%) translateZ(0)">n</span><span style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(10%) translateZ(0)">.</span></div>​</span><span data-testid="animated-words"><div class="sc-aa5615b6-6 ePCqHY"><span style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(10%) translateZ(0)">I</span><span style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(10%) translateZ(0)">m</span><span style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(10%) translateZ(0)">p</span><span style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(10%) translateZ(0)">a</span><span style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(10%) translateZ(0)">c</span><span style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(10%) translateZ(0)">t</span><span style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(10%) translateZ(0)">.</span></div>​</span></h1><h2 data-hero-appearance="homepage" class="sc-aa5615b6-4 jIORjt" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(100px) translateZ(0)">Project Catalyst is the world’s largest decentralized innovation engine for solving real-world challenges.</h2></section></div><div class="sc-9658e87-0 ffCJK"><section class="sc-26662a19-0 sc-302a1274-0 iXUvQa jUdviw"><h2 class="sc-302a1274-1 fpghno">Latest news</h2><a href="/news" class="sc-96cacaf5-1 sc-302a1274-2 hFURup iOPmci">View more news</a><div data-carousel="true" class="sc-3f0404e5-0 IdYMK sc-302a1274-3 lgwKTB"><div class="sc-3f0404e5-1 iACJJJ"><div data-carousel-scroll-track="true" class="sc-3f0404e5-2 eDFIqI"><div data-content-card="true" class="sc-3f0404e5-3 ikcaKt"><a draggable="false" target="_self" data-appearance="mini" data-testid="report-card" href="/reports/horizons2025.pdf" class="sc-5781915-1 sc-c1e4f963-0 btqWXy foySzo"><div data-image-container="true" class="sc-5781915-13 eCbavn"><img draggable="false" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/p68h9w04/production/c7b84e8f9e4d0e2c1135732c8e959a2b36e7ad3d-1920x1080.png" loading="lazy" class="sc-5781915-14 iBZioG"/></div><div data-card-content="true"><h2 data-card-title="true" class="sc-5781915-0 loNuLl">Catalyst Horizons Annual Report 2025</h2><div data-card-date-and-cta="true" class="sc-c1e4f963-5 iOMtMu"><div data-meta="true" class="sc-5f40dbd0-0 gntPbA"><time dateTime="2025-04-09T04:00:00.000Z" data-date-time="true" class="sc-1302307b-0 KDmCQ">Apr 9, 2025</time> </div><span data-card-cta="true" data-id="card-button" class="sc-5f40dbd0-1 hEesvH"><svg width="20" height="22" viewBox="0 0 22 22" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-icon="true"><path d="M1 16v1.25A3.75 3.75 0 0 0 4.75 21h12.5A3.75 3.75 0 0 0 21 17.25V16m-5-5-5 5m0 0-5-5m5 5V1" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span></div></div></a></div><div data-content-card="true" class="sc-3f0404e5-3 ikcaKt"><a draggable="false" target="_blank" data-appearance="mini" data-testid="video-card" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cO6EeWsY_ZQ" class="sc-5781915-1 sc-c1e4f963-0 btqWXy foySzo"><div data-image-container="true" class="sc-5781915-13 eCbavn"><img draggable="false" alt="Project Catalyst Weekly Town Hall #220" src="https://i.ytimg.com/vi/cO6EeWsY_ZQ/hqdefault.jpg" loading="lazy" class="sc-5781915-14 iBZioG"/></div><div data-card-content="true"><h2 data-card-title="true" class="sc-5781915-0 loNuLl">Project Catalyst Weekly Town Hall #220</h2><div data-card-date-and-cta="true" class="sc-c1e4f963-5 iOMtMu"><div data-meta="true" class="sc-5f40dbd0-0 gntPbA"> </div><span data-card-cta="true" data-id="card-button" class="sc-5f40dbd0-1 hEesvH"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="m14 5 7 7m0 0-7 7m7-7H3"></path></svg></span></div></div></a></div><div data-content-card="true" class="sc-3f0404e5-3 ikcaKt"><a draggable="false" target="_self" data-appearance="mini" data-testid="blog-post-card" href="/blog/update-from-the-catalyst-team" class="sc-5781915-1 sc-c1e4f963-0 btqWXy foySzo"><div data-image-container="true" class="sc-5781915-13 eCbavn"><img draggable="false" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/p68h9w04/production/20038baf04b5b9cbc406932b4b68a73bf8889b72-1200x628.svg" loading="lazy" class="sc-5781915-14 iBZioG"/></div><div data-card-content="true"><h2 data-card-title="true" class="sc-5781915-0 loNuLl">Update from the Catalyst Team</h2><div data-card-date-and-cta="true" class="sc-c1e4f963-5 iOMtMu"><div data-meta="true" class="sc-5f40dbd0-0 gntPbA"><time dateTime="2026-02-05T12:56:24.183Z" data-date-time="true" class="sc-1302307b-0 KDmCQ">Feb 5, 2026</time> <!-- --> <!-- -->· <span>3<!-- --> min read</span></div><span data-card-cta="true" data-id="card-button" class="sc-5f40dbd0-1 hEesvH"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="m14 5 7 7m0 0-7 7m7-7H3"></path></svg></span></div></div></a></div></div></div></div></section><section class="sc-26662a19-0 sc-42693f5f-0 iXUvQa etCUob"><a id="how-it-works" class="sc-7fa49818-0 vuRZU"></a><div class="sc-42693f5f-2 cePTGI" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(100px) translateZ(0)"><h3 class="sc-42693f5f-1 gqTptE" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(100px) translateZ(0)">How it works</h3><div class="sc-42693f5f-3 PlbbG"><button aria-label="Play" class="sc-42693f5f-5 ljsQoo"><svg data-icon="true" width="160" height="160" viewBox="0 0 160 160" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="sc-1c34d5df-0 eteiwG sc-42693f5f-6 dILWrL"><circle opacity="0.4" cx="80" cy="80" r="60" fill="var(--icon-bg-primary, #133FF0)"></circle><path d="M98.3462 74.453L77.0313 60.2431C72.601 57.2895 66.6667 60.4655 66.6667 65.7901V94.2099C66.6667 99.5345 72.601 102.71 77.0313 99.7569L98.3462 85.547C102.304 82.9082 102.304 77.0918 98.3462 74.453Z" stroke="white" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M140 80C140 113.137 113.137 140 80 140C46.8629 140 20 113.137 20 80C20 46.8629 46.8629 20 80 20C113.137 20 140 46.8629 140 80Z" stroke="white" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div class="sc-42693f5f-7 gvqonc"><p>At the start of each funding round, the Cardano community proposes ideas that solve challenges within the blockchain ecosystem and the wider world. The community then evaluates and votes on which technical, business, creative, and community proposals will receive funding.</p> <p>Join us and you too could make change happen.</p><a href="/get-involved/how-it-works" data-button="true" data-appearance="primary" class="sc-96cacaf5-0 gvcsjr">Learn more</a></div></div></section><div data-testid="global-community" class="sc-1fb0a292-0 iVTdgv"><section class="sc-26662a19-0 iXUvQa"><h3 class="sc-1fb0a292-1 loWGkH" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(100px) translateZ(0)">Our global community</h3><div class="sc-1fb0a292-2 eA-dHlN" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(100px) translateZ(0)"><p>Community is at the heart of Project Catalyst. That&#x27;s why we empower every member of the Cardano community to actively participate in the development of the network. Ideas can come from anyone and anywhere within our global network, no matter their background or location.</p> <p>Our community has already voted on 11,233 proposals, that’s a total of 3,257,805 votes cast so far. Everyone has a part to play.</p></div><div class="sc-1fb0a292-3 eixdCh"><div data-size="default" data-appearance="default" aria-label="total funding 150M USD+" class="sc-6bf99239-0 iObXJq"><h2 data-align="center" aria-label="Value" class="sc-6bf99239-1 hzoRLH">150M USD<!-- -->+</h2><div data-align="center" class="sc-6bf99239-2 hOmuKR">total funding</div></div><div data-size="default" data-appearance="default" aria-label="proposals funded 2221" class="sc-6bf99239-0 iObXJq"><h2 data-align="center" aria-label="Value" class="sc-6bf99239-1 hzoRLH">2,221</h2><div data-align="center" class="sc-6bf99239-2 hOmuKR">proposals funded</div></div><div data-size="default" data-appearance="default" aria-label="members 84.9K+" class="sc-6bf99239-0 iObXJq"><h2 data-align="center" aria-label="Value" class="sc-6bf99239-1 hzoRLH">84,902<!-- -->+</h2><div data-align="center" class="sc-6bf99239-2 hOmuKR">members</div></div></div></section><div class="sc-ebd465c3-0 jOWvgT"><div class="sc-ebd465c3-1 dyHiOt" style="transform:translateX(0%) translateZ(0)"><div class="sc-ebd465c3-2 kmUnJg"></div></div></div></div><div class="sc-2672749a-0 jmNRzD"><section class="sc-26662a19-0 sc-2672749a-1 iXUvQa gTjhlH"><h3 class="sc-2672749a-2 jXsfHd" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(100px) translateZ(0)">Join us</h3><div><p class="sc-2672749a-3 byoOhL" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(100px) translateZ(0)">There are lots of ways you can get involved in our community and many of them reward with Cardano&#x27;s native asset, ada. If you have an idea or just want to find out more, <a href="https://projectcatalyst.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="sc-2672749a-5 diuRes">join the Catalyst platform</a> or <a href="#mailing-list" class="sc-2672749a-5 diuRes">sign up for updates</a> and all the latest news.</p><div class="sc-2672749a-4 fdatbZ"><div class="sc-204cff5f-0 klOZPu" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(100px) translateZ(0)"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 50 60" fill="none" width="50px"><path stroke="var(--theme-color-icon-blue, #3EA2FF)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M20.935 42.454h13.63M27.75 1.621v2.917M46.312 9.31l-2.063 2.062M54 27.87h-2.916m-46.667 0H1.5m9.75-16.5L9.189 9.31m8.25 28.873c-5.695-5.695-5.695-14.929 0-20.624s14.929-5.695 20.624 0 5.695 14.929 0 20.624l-1.596 1.596a9.84 9.84 0 0 0-2.883 6.96v1.549a5.833 5.833 0 0 1-11.666 0v-1.55a9.84 9.84 0 0 0-2.883-6.96z"></path></svg><div class="sc-204cff5f-1 cOgZdp">Submit a proposal</div><p class="sc-204cff5f-2 feykKp">Want to solve a problem on Cardano or in the wider world? Find out how to submit a proposal.</p><a href="/get-involved/submit-an-idea" class="sc-204cff5f-3 eQhkYV"><div>Learn more</div></a></div><div class="sc-204cff5f-0 klOZPu" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(100px) translateZ(0)"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 50 60" fill="none" width="50px"><path stroke="#3EA2FF" stroke-miterlimit="10" stroke-width="2" d="m10.288 29.902-7.584 5.28a2.93 2.93 0 0 0-.787 1.983v10.237a2.925 2.925 0 0 0 2.916 2.917h40.834a2.925 2.925 0 0 0 2.916-2.917v-10.15c0-.787-.32-1.517-.846-2.07l-8.195-5.28"></path><path stroke="#3EA2FF" stroke-miterlimit="10" stroke-width="2" d="M25.217 3.482 14.059 14.639a5.28 5.28 0 0 0 0 7.466l7.446 7.445a5.28 5.28 0 0 0 7.465 0l11.158-11.157a5.28 5.28 0 0 0 0-7.466l-7.445-7.445a5.28 5.28 0 0 0-7.466 0Z"></path><path stroke="#3EA2FF" stroke-width="2" d="M4.833 42.5h40.834"></path></svg><div class="sc-204cff5f-1 cOgZdp">Vote on an idea</div><p class="sc-204cff5f-2 feykKp">View the proposals in the current Fund and choose the ones you think will have most impact. To vote, download the Project Catalyst voting app.</p><a href="/get-involved/become-a-voter" class="sc-204cff5f-3 eQhkYV"><div>Learn more</div></a></div><div class="sc-204cff5f-0 klOZPu" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(100px) translateZ(0)"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 50 60" fill="none" width="50px"><path fill="var(--theme-color-icon-blue, #3EA2FF)" d="M13.457 32.997a1 1 0 0 0-1.414 1.414zm5.126 6.54-.707.708a1 1 0 0 0 1.414 0zm12.374-10.959a1 1 0 0 0-1.414-1.414zm9.96-15.29v35h2v-35zM36.083 53.12H6.917v2h29.166zm-34-4.833v-35h-2v35zM6.917 8.454h5.833v-2H6.917zm23.333 0h5.833v-2H30.25zM6.917 53.121a4.833 4.833 0 0 1-4.834-4.833h-2a6.833 6.833 0 0 0 6.834 6.833zm34-4.833a4.833 4.833 0 0 1-4.834 4.833v2a6.833 6.833 0 0 0 6.834-6.833zm2-35a6.833 6.833 0 0 0-6.834-6.834v2a4.833 4.833 0 0 1 4.834 4.834zm-40.834 0a4.833 4.833 0 0 1 4.834-4.834v-2a6.833 6.833 0 0 0-6.834 6.834zm9.96 21.123 5.833 5.834 1.414-1.414-5.833-5.834zm7.247 5.834 11.667-11.667-1.414-1.414-11.667 11.667zM18.583 2.62h5.834v-2h-5.834zm5.834 9.667h-5.834v2h5.834zm-5.834 0a4.833 4.833 0 0 1-4.833-4.834h-2a6.833 6.833 0 0 0 6.833 6.834zM29.25 7.454a4.833 4.833 0 0 1-4.833 4.834v2a6.833 6.833 0 0 0 6.833-6.834zm-4.833-4.833a4.833 4.833 0 0 1 4.833 4.833h2A6.833 6.833 0 0 0 24.417.621zm-5.834-2a6.833 6.833 0 0 0-6.833 6.833h2a4.833 4.833 0 0 1 4.833-4.833z"></path></svg><div class="sc-204cff5f-1 cOgZdp">Become a Community Reviewer</div><p class="sc-204cff5f-2 feykKp">Become a Community Reviewer and you’ll be rewarded in ada for reviewing and rating submitted ideas for quality assurance.</p><a href="/get-involved/become-a-community-reviewer" class="sc-204cff5f-3 eQhkYV"><div>Learn more</div></a></div></div></div></section></div>0<section data-appearance="default" class="sc-e063a900-0 djPPjf"><section class="sc-26662a19-0 iXUvQa"><h3 class="sc-e063a900-1 kphWIo" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(100px) translateZ(0)">Latest Categories</h3><p class="sc-e063a900-2 bJugqf" style="opa