ept will accept early stage ideas to deliver proof of concept, design research and basic prototyping through to MVP for…</p></a></div><div data-content-card="true" class="sc-3f0404e5-3 ikcaKt"><a data-challenge="425" draggable="false" data-testid="challenge-card" href="/funds/13/cardano-use-cases-product" class="sc-5781915-1 btqWXy"><h4 class="sc-d9054938-1 fMiwkk">Launched <time dateTime="2024-09-25T11:00:00.000Z" data-date-time="true" class="sc-1302307b-0 KDmCQ">Sep 2024</time></h4><h2 class="sc-5781915-0 loNuLl">F<!-- -->13<!-- -->: <!-- -->Cardano Use Cases: Product</h2><div class="sc-5781915-3 sc-5781915-5 ksIxSr bLdNLB"><div data-stat="fundsAvailable" class="sc-d9054938-0 dUFvIR"><div role="cell" aria-label="Budget" class="sc-5781915-7 cbvRkt">8.5M $ADA</div><div class="sc-5781915-9 jyEWEu">Budget</div></div><div data-stat="totalProjectsFunded" class="sc-d9054938-0 dUFvIR"><div role="cell" aria-label="Proposals approved" class="sc-5781915-7 cbvRkt">23<span class="sc-5781915-8 gKHDwh">/<!-- -->199</span></div><div class="sc-5781915-9 jyEWEu">Proposals funded</div></div></div><p class="sc-5781915-10 igELKx">Cardano Use Cases: Product is for established blockchain projects and teams looking to enhance existing applications and propositions by significantly…</p></a></div></div></div><div class="sc-14a118e8-0 iRmWts"><div class="sc-14a118e8-1 btguot"></div></div></div><section class="sc-26662a19-0 sc-e063a900-3 eBZAMg"><a href="/funds/13" data-button="true" data-appearance="primary" class="sc-96cacaf5-0 gvcsjr">View more categories</a></section></section><section data-appearance="secondary" class="sc-e063a900-0 djPPjf"><section class="sc-26662a19-0 iXUvQa"><h3 class="sc-e063a900-1 kphWIo" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(100px) translateZ(0)">How funding works</h3><p class="sc-e063a900-2 bJugqf" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(100px) translateZ(0)">Every few months, a new fund begins with a set amount of ada budgeted. Millions of ada is available as gran